    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d990-a1">

                <pb facs="0754" n="638" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg638"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]<anchor n="75" xml:id="d990-f1"/></seg>
                </opener>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-24T11:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 24, 1914, 11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In view of relations existing [etc. as in above telegram] place of safety,
                    bringing current accounts and fee stamps with you. Procure vouchers for
                    transportation expenses of your family.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d990-f1" n="75" xml:id="d990-f1-content">
                <p>Sent to Puerto Mexico and Progreso, adding to the latter the word “code” after
                    “bringing,” and omitting last sentence.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
